      "message": "What do others think about moving the CPP/H files for the color filter subclasses into `src/effects/colorfilters`. That would parallel `src/effects/imagefilters` and makes it easy to find all implementations together. \n\nSkColorFilter.cpp and SkColorFilterBase would stay in src/core potentially, but I could also see SkColorFilterBase going to src/effects/colorfilters.\n\nI\u0027m sad to see Rob\u0027s work to consolidate all the color filter subclasses into internal CPP files, but that had been a design goal before we needed to break out the asFragmentProcessor functionality. And I don\u0027t see a way around that unless we move the data fields into a union/variant that\u0027s on SkColorFilterBase and make type non-virtual.",
